Package: ggsegMiccai
Title: MICCAI 2012 Multi-Atlas Labeling Brain Atlas for the 'ggseg' Ecosystem
Version: 1.0.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person("Athanasia Mo", "Mowinckel", , "a.m.mowinckel@psykologi.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5756-0223"))
  )
Description: Neuromorphometrics maximum probability tissue labels, derived
    from the MICCAI 2012 Grand Challenge and Workshop on Multi-Atlas Labeling
    and distributed with SPM12, for the 'ggseg' ecosystem. Provides cortical
    and subcortical 'ggseg_atlas' objects with both 2D polygon geometry and 3D
    vertex indices, for use with 'ggseg' and 'ggseg3d'. The label data are
    released under CC BY-NC; MRI scans originate from the OASIS project and
    the labeled data are provided by Neuromorphometrics, Inc. under academic
    subscription.
